$NetBSD$

etags is installed as emacs-etags, so that it does not collide with the etags
in the base system.  etc/ctags.1 is a .so link to the etags manual page and has
to follow the rename, or man ctags finds nothing.

--- etc/ctags.1.orig	Sun Oct  3 14:14:21 1999
+++ etc/ctags.1	Wed Apr 24 16:57:49 2002
@@ -1 +1 @@
-.so man1/etags.1
+.so man1/emacs-etags.1
